  {
   "number": 2,
   "section": 1,
   "name_zh": "右揽雀尾",
   "name_pinyin": "Yòu lǎn què wěi",
   "name_en": "Grasp the Bird’s Tail (Right)",
   "name_id": "Menangkap Ekor Burung (Kanan)",
   "start_sec": 8,
   "end_sec": 18,
   "end_x": 3.2,
   "end_y": 5.3,
   "facing_en": "[to be filled in from the reference]",
   "facing_id": "[diisi dari referensi]",
   "steps": {
    "en": [
     "Turn the right toes slightly out and the body slightly right. Bend the right arm in front of the chest, palm down; circle the left hand to the right of the abdomen, palm up, as if holding a ball. Shift the weight onto the right leg and draw the left foot beside the right foot.",
     "Turn the body slightly left and step the left foot forward to the left, placing the heel down lightly.",
     "Keep turning left into a left bow stance. The left arm wards off forward, left hand at shoulder height; the right hand drops beside the right hip, palm down.",
     "Turn slightly left and draw the right foot beside the left foot. Bend the left arm in front of the chest, palm down, and circle the right hand to the left of the abdomen, palm up: holding a ball on the left."
    ],
    "id": [
     "Putar ujung kaki kanan sedikit keluar dan badan sedikit ke kanan. Tekuk lengan kanan di depan dada, telapak menghadap bawah; lingkarkan tangan kiri ke sisi kanan perut, telapak menghadap atas, seperti memeluk bola. Pindahkan berat badan ke kaki kanan dan tarik kaki kiri ke samping kaki kanan.",
     "Putar badan sedikit ke kiri dan langkahkan kaki kiri ke depan kiri, tumit menyentuh lantai dengan ringan.",
     "Terus berputar ke kiri menjadi kuda-kuda busur kiri. Lengan kiri menangkis ke depan, tangan kiri setinggi bahu; tangan kanan turun di samping pinggul kanan, telapak menghadap bawah.",
     "Putar sedikit ke kiri dan tarik kaki kanan ke samping kaki kiri. Tekuk lengan kiri di depan dada, telapak menghadap bawah, dan lingkarkan tangan kanan ke sisi kiri perut, telapak menghadap atas: memeluk bola di kiri."
    ]
   },
   "key_points": {
    "en": [
     "Turn from the waist; the arms follow the body.",
     "Keep the shoulders and elbows sunk (沉肩坠肘 chén jiān zhuì zhǒu).",
     "Shift the weight fully before stepping."
    ],
    "id": [
     "Putar dari pinggang; lengan mengikuti badan.",
     "Bahu dan siku tetap turun (沉肩坠肘 chén jiān zhuì zhǒu).",
     "Pindahkan berat badan sepenuhnya sebelum melangkah."
    ]
   },
